WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
I'm here to say thank you on behalf of my master

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:06,700
Thanks to the Pei family’s little boxing gold for saving our young master

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,100
There’s a lot going on at home today

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:11,140
Tomorrow, Yin’s family will definitely visit us personally.

5
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,860
What is the name of that child of the Yin family?

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,540
Yin Wuyang

7
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:18,100
That child is seven years old this year, right?

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,700
If I hadn't gotten sick, I would have entered the first grade of elementary school.

9
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,700
What a pity

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,460
Danbo, a descendant of the Yin family

11
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,220
Yin Wuyang is the only seedling

12
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,620
It’s a pity that I have genius syndrome

13
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:32,540
Very good brain

14
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,340
But don’t communicate with people

15
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:37,230
Staying behind closed doors all year round

16
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:39,710
Even our neighbor has never met him.

17
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,390
Our Jiaojiao is awesome

18
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:43,230
Grandma is proud of you

19
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:45,190
Although with the status of the Pei family

20
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:47,070
No need to curry favor with the Indian family

21
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:49,750
But who would want to have more connections with a miracle doctor?

22
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:52,270
Let’s walk around more with the Yin family from now on

23
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:55,430
This is all Jiaojiao’s fault. Jiaojiao

24
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:59,090
It was you who saved Yin Wuyang

25
00:00:59,090 --> 00:01:02,510
Her reaction wasn't quite right

26
00:01:02,510 --> 00:01:11,360
How did you save her? Tingjun

27
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:13,600
what do you mean

28
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:16,140
Do you doubt Jiaojiao?

29
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:18,880
Who else could it be if she wasn’t Jiaojiao?

30
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:21,560
How could a three-and-a-half-year-old child lie?

31
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,160
When Miss Youyou comes back

32
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:25,530
Dirty all over

33
00:01:25,530 --> 00:01:28,260
Could it be that she saved Young Master Yin?

34
00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:29,900
Absolutely impossible

35
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:31,860
I don’t dislike Youyou

36
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:33,820
The palms and backs of the hands are all flesh

37
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:35,260
She is my granddaughter

38
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,860
Of course I feel bad

39
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:38,540
But she grew up in the country

40
00:01:38,540 --> 00:01:39,820
Don't understand anything

41
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:42,040
How can we save people?

42
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:44,440
Jiaojiao is different

43
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:47,160
The child our Pei family called

44
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:48,680
Well-behaved and kind

45
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,960
Lively and cheerful

46
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,840
More likeable

47
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,200
Miss Mingming Youyou

48
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:56,720
This is the real bloodline of the Pei family

49
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:59,400
If Miss Youyou had not been exchanged

50
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,120
The pampering that Pei Jiaojiao enjoys

51
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,960
It should all be hers
